BraleModule_EstimateOutput
├── when params are invalid
│   └── it should return zero and the input token
├── when input and output have the same decimals
│   └── it should return the amount and the output token
├── when output has fewer decimals
│   ├── it should divide by the decimal difference
│   └── it should truncate (fuzz)
├── when output has more decimals
│   ├── it should multiply by the decimal difference
│   └── when the multiplication overflows
│       └── it should return zero and the output token
├── when the output token has no code
│   └── it should return zero and the output token
├── when the output token returns a non-uint8 decimals value
│   └── it should return zero and the output token
├── when the output token returns huge returndata for decimals
│   └── it should read only the first word
└── when the output token has no decimals function
    └── it should return zero and the output token
